# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GBIF credentials — TEMPLATE
#
# 1. Copy this file to `.Renviron` in the project root.
# 2. Replace the placeholder values with your own GBIF account details.
# 3. Restart R so that the variables are loaded.
#
# `.Renviron` is listed in .gitignore and must NEVER be committed.
# Register free of charge at https://www.gbif.org/user/profile
#
# Note: `.Renviron` is not an R script. Do not quote values unless the value
# itself contains spaces, and make sure the file ends with a newline.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

GBIF_USER=your_gbif_username
GBIF_PWD=your_gbif_password
GBIF_EMAIL=your.address@example.org

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CORINE Land Cover — OPTIONAL
#
# Leave unset to read CLC from the EEA's map service, which needs no account.
# To use the vector product downloaded from land.copernicus.eu instead (it
# needs an EU Login), give the full path to the unzipped .gpkg or .gdb. Keep
# the file outside this repository; only the Kosovo extract is written here.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# CLC_PATH=D:/data/clc/U2018_CLC2018_V2020_20u1.gpkg
